All fifteen HTML output files, including the collection manifest, are byte-identical across the two generation runs. All fourteen Markdown generation files are also byte-identical, and adopted chapter 06 Markdown equals the generated projection. The prior twelve HTML pages and CSS remain unchanged. No generation budget adjustment was required by this chapter.

This is a specification-page migration review, not evidence that Math evaluation or MathML/KaTeX runtime acceptance is complete. Human screen-reader and real Safari device operations were not performed. No tracked source was edited by this reviewer; local evidence hashes are sealed in seal.json.
